# Veyra

Veyra is a lightweight, dependency-free endpoint monitoring tool built with Python.

It checks HTTP endpoints, measures response time, detects failures, and generates
machine-readable JSON reports. Veyra is designed for developers, infrastructure
teams, and CI/CD environments that need a simple way to monitor service health.

## Features

- Monitor multiple HTTP/HTTPS endpoints
- Measure response time
- Validate expected HTTP status codes
- Configurable request timeout
- Automatic retry support
- JSON report generation
- Concurrent endpoint checks
- Zero external dependencies
- CI/CD friendly exit codes
- Simple configuration

